{"lyrics":"[00:07.56] (Reaper on the beat)\n[Chorus]\n[00:20.82] Even when I'm asleep, I feel awake (Awake) when you're away\n[00:24.18] Everything with you is such a chase, (Chase) cut to the chase\n[00:27.60] Almost left my side the other day, (Day) it makes me shake\n[00:30.84] Knowin' you were gon' walk away, (Away) you can't be replaced\n[00:34.16] Can't tell you how I feel, I can't explain (Explain)\n[00:36.94] For you I'ma try to get these lyrics out my brain (Brain)\n[00:40.22] And for you I will fly, through the hell, through the flames (Flames)\n[00:43.80] Always, always, love you always\n[Verse 1]\n[00:47.14] For your love, workin' all day, fuck a off day\n[00:50.30] You lookin' cute in your Bape shit baby, you could go Ape\n[00:53.74] All of these other bitches are Shenenehs, Martin like Payne\n[00:57.28] I am in love with a beautiful lady, she's in my brain\n[01:00.52] Star you set my heart on fire, 420 blaze\n[01:03.96] Yeah, no cliché, I can't explain\n[01:07.68] I got your name, tatted on my brain, tatted on my mind\n[01:12.50] Teen Titan, got the Starfire by my side\n[01:15.90] Clark Kent if she kiss me, it make me fly\n[01:19.32] Sad boy, if she leaves me it makes me cry\n[01:22.72] Flash boy, if she needs me, be there in no time\n[01:26.60] She's all right, so I gave it a go, I gave it a turn\n[01:33.42] I gave her my heart, I'm willin' to learn\n[01:36.56] And it changed my life, I'm tryna get close with the stars tonight\n[Chorus]\n[01:43.04] Even when I'm asleep, I feel awake (Awake) when you're away\n[01:46.46] Everything with you is such a chase, (Chase) cut to the chase\n[01:49.88] Almost left my side the other day, (Day) it makes me shake\n[01:53.12] Knowin' you were gon' walk away, (Away) you can't be replaced\n[01:56.48] Can't tell you how I feel, I can't explain (Explain)\n[01:59.22] For you I'ma try to get these lyrics out my brain (Brain)\n[02:02.04] And for you I will fly, through the hell, through the flames (Flames)\n[02:06.36] Alwa